<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu edges up to 4.669 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu edges up to 4.669 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged up to 4.669 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.671 on Monday.</p>
<p>				    Mar 4		   Mar 3</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.669		   4.671</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    400,000		 200,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
